WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.390
A century after Mari,

2
00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:08.589
the Armenian Kingdom of Cilicia
had lost most of its lands.

3
00:00:08.629 --> 00:00:11.439
Mamluk armies had taken
its port and its cities,

4
00:00:11.479 --> 00:00:14.799
and their raids had reached
the capital, Sis.

5
00:00:15.159 --> 00:00:19.609
In 1374 the crown went
to Leo of Lusignan,

6
00:00:19.649 --> 00:00:21.249
a prince from Cyprus,

7
00:00:21.289 --> 00:00:24.274
and he and his queen
were crowned at Sis.

8
00:00:24.314 --> 00:00:29.339
Within months the Mamluk armies were
in Cilicia, and the town of Sis fell.

9
00:00:29.699 --> 00:00:32.689
The king held out
behind the castle walls.

10
00:00:32.729 --> 00:00:35.408
Appeals for help
to Europe had failed.

11
00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:40.878
In April 1375, promised his life,
he accepted terms,

12
00:00:40.918 --> 00:00:43.704
and was taken to Cairo
as a prisoner.

13
00:00:43.744 --> 00:00:46.845
So ended
the Armenian Kingdom of Cilicia.

14
00:00:46.885 --> 00:00:52.228
Freed in 1382,
Leo died in Paris in 1393.

15
00:00:52.588 --> 00:00:56.070
Hold the castle
for the newly crowned king.

